# Moto G20 (java): GPU driver load
#
# The Mali GPU driver is not part of the kernel tree. It ships as the
# stock binary module mali_gondul.ko (r25p1-01bet0) on the preserved
# socko vendor-module partition, alongside the other stock SoC modules.
# Without this line surfaceflinger aborts with
# 'eglQueryStringImplementationANDROID(EGL_VERSION) failed' and the
# boot stalls at the logo.
on post-fs
    insmod ${ro.vendor.ko.mount.point}/socko/mali_gondul.ko
